OL,3,ATwo-year curfew lifted in Sudan's
OL,4,Acapital
OL,5,
OL,6,FSudan's military-led government has
OL,7,Flifted a curfew and state of emergency
OL,8,Fin Khartoum imposed more than two years
OL,9,Fago, state media says.
OL,11,FThe authorities are taking this step 18
OL,12,Fmonths after the army seized back
OL,13,Fcontrol of the capital from the
OL,14,Fparamilitary Rapid Support Forces
OL,15,F(RSF), which it has been fighting in a
OL,16,Fcivil war now in its fourth year.
OL,18,FBut clashes continue in the south and
OL,19,Fwest, with mounting evidence that the
OL,20,Fwar is spilling across Sudan's borders.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
