OL,3,ATwo-year curfew lifted in Sudan's
OL,4,Acapital
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than two million of the roughly
OL,7,Ffive million people who fled Khartoum
OL,8,Fafter war erupted in April 2023 have
OL,9,Freturned to the city since fighting
OL,10,Fthere ended in March 2025, according to
OL,11,Fthe International Organization for
OL,12,FMigration.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
